I would like to make a request for a monk character in nethack.
He would gain special skills as his level increases with the altimate skill
being the finger of death.  Also, his best weapon would be his hand. 
As he increases in level, he would do increasingly more damage with his
hand.

Also, how about restricting the types of weapon a given character can
use.  There could be a minus to hit if a character uses a weapon
that was not appropriate for his class. 

All the above ideas are from AD&D (as if you couldn't tell).


